   3.977100685385311*^9, 
   3.9771007368700647`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"6776a532-7f5f-4e13-bf42-\
933ffe542cca"],

Cell["\<\
For physicists who need to understand or reproduce derivations\[LongDash]the \
index raising, lowering, and contracting, \[ScriptCapitalU]\[ScriptCapitalD] \
furnishes the complementary and layered frontend services:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.976805343965353*^9, {3.976807171258144*^9, 3.976807218345378*^9}, {
   3.976807258054213*^9, 3.976807372892746*^9}, {3.9768074213746433`*^9, 
   3.9768076068674717`*^9}, {3.976807777446004*^9, 3.9768078346242523`*^9}, {
