   3.977100951690284*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"ac11065a-983d-41e1-bb53-\
4da011fe9a1f"],

Cell["\<\
Bridges: \[ScriptCapitalU]\[ScriptCapitalD] will map to Wolfram\
\[CloseCurlyQuote]s existing support for tensors as a target virtual machine.\
\
\>", "Item",
